@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix mf: <http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/tests/test-manifest#> .
@prefix n3t: <http://example.org/n3/test#> .
<> a mf:Manifest ; mf:entries ( <http://example.org/n3/universal-forall-rules> ) .
<http://example.org/n3/universal-forall-rules> a n3t:Rules ; mf:name "universal-forall-rules" ; mf:action [ n3t:ruleDocument <rules.n3> ; n3t:factsGraph <facts.n3> ] ; mf:result "universal-forall-rules" ; mf:status n3t:proposed ; rdfs:comment """A document-scoped @forAll universal quantifies the rule variables; each ex:Thing fact yields the ex:Known classification for that same term.""" .
